        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 14,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "But the more part of them were desirous that they might destroy Alma and Amulek; for they were angry with Alma, because of the plainness of his words unto Zeezrom; and they also said that Amulek had lied unto them, and had reviled against their law and also against their lawyers and judges.",
